# Project Pinnacle — Cursor Agent Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before any change.

## Shared goal

Ship tournament-ready golf performance features for **Road to Gamble Sands** (handicap 12.4 → 3, Aug 20–23, 2026). Production: https://project-pinnacle.vercel.app

## Architecture

- Canonical branch: `main`
- Multi-route app: `app/today`, `app/plan`, `app/practice`, `app/recovery`, `app/performance`, `app/tournament` with bottom-tab navigation
- Do **not** rebuild the app on parallel branches or introduce a conflicting architecture without explicit human approval

## Coordination with other agents

| Agent | Your relationship |
|-------|-------------------|
| Codex explorer/reviewer/docs-researcher | Read-only helpers; cite their findings, you own writes |
| Claude Code | Same `AGENTS.md` and repo skill; avoid conflicting PRs |
| ecc-tools[bot] | Config generation only; regenerate ECC after structural changes |

## Before merge

```bash
npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm run build
```

## PR hygiene

- One open app-feature PR at a time
- Reference localStorage keys and tournament impact in PR descriptions
- Close or update stale PRs that propose alternate architectures
